# <<< buildflow-managed (.gitignore) <<<

/webphone

# Visual-harness output (scripts/ui-capture.py). LOCAL-ONLY by budget
# decision. NON-track runs regenerate their working set; a --track run
# NEVER wipes — history is the product (timestamped run dirs, gallery/
# compare/wire-facts ride along) and retention is the operator's --prune
# call. Remote shots carry REAL data; keep this gitignored.
/ui-shots/
/ui-shots-fax-off/

# Regenerable probe/screenshot artifacts (2026-11-05 sweep, same doctrine
# as the /ui-shots/ budget decision: the shots are eyeball material;
# the assertions that make them evidence live in scripts/ui-capture.py).
/buildflow-fsprobe-*
/ui-shots-before/
